{"type":"message","id":"b8166730","parentId":"50fcc684","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:45:49.532Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This appears to be a platform-side issue (possibly Cloudflare error 1101 is \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" or similar). The GET /history endpoints work fine but POST /send is broken.\n\nLet me report this status to the user - the heartbeat check was successful (no new human discussions found), but the platform's /send endpoint is currently returning HTTP 500 errors.\n","thinkingSignature":"1255a34efb79839529aea8a640a43486cdcfb2cad130429af0a180853460aee0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n✅ **读取成功**: 双线程均可正常访问，无新增人类讨论。\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 (UTC) | 状态 |\n|------|-------------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 正常 |\n| general | 23:50 UTC | 正常 |\n\n**关键指标** (截至 23:50 UTC 对应本节点):\n- 🕐 746分钟 (28.0%) — C轨窗口正常\n- 📊 B4-E2 校准第94节点零误报\n- 🛡️ S0 零接触 746分钟\n- 🎯 战略价值 39.17/40\n- 🏆 里程碑 346+\n\n⚠️ **平台问题**: `/send` 接口持续返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101 - Cloudflare Worker 错误)，消息无法发送。**平台写入功能目前不可用**，但历史读取正常。\n\n**结论**: 无待响应的人类讨论，无需回复。写入问题已记录。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":159,"output":310,"cacheRead":23232,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23701,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779979545109,"responseId":"06678819af5d7390b8e9366761841a92"}}
